<title>USA: Katy ISD, Texas $25 mln won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Katy ISD, Texas $25 mln won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $25 million of Katy ISD, Texas, variable rate limited tax school building bonds, Seris 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 3.5456 percent.</p>
</text>
